# K1 -- EmuDESK drag outline (the desktop's only VDI drawing, gr_drgplns via
# kernel/src/desk/vdibind.rs, which since K1 draws on the AES's workstation
# gl_handle instead of a virtual workstation of its own). Card and desktop as
# evb-desk.actions (newdesk-evb-desk.inf, no #Z). Press on the C drive icon
# (38,30), drag it without releasing over the empty desktop -- the dotted
# XOR outline must follow -- then back onto the icon and release (a
# self-drop, EmuTOS cancels it, deskact.c:666-670; nothing is written).
# Ticks hz_200 after "[desk] desktop up" (desk-arm-m3.py).
100 parkbr
400 mark A_IDLE
600 move 38 30
800 down
900 drag 200 200
1300 mark B_DRAG_200_200
1500 drag 320 140
1900 mark C_DRAG_320_140
2100 drag 38 30
2400 mark D_BACK
2600 up
3000 mark E_RELEASED
3200 parkbr
3600 mark END
